## Invariants — rules the system must never violate

- {{e.g. API routes contain no UI logic}}
- {{e.g. Components contain no DB logic}}
- {{e.g. Agent code in /agents never imports from components or actions}}
- {{e.g. Server actions never call agents}}
- {{e.g. Anything behind the load balancer keeps zero per-user state in-process}}
- {{e.g. Auth AND ownership are enforced at every mutation boundary, not just at the UI}}
- {{e.g. Public routes are an explicit list; everything else is protected by default}}
- {{e.g. Metadata lives in Postgres; large artifacts live in blob storage — never in DB columns}}

